---
import { type BaseSectionProps } from '../../types/components';

interface Props extends BaseSectionProps {}
const { id = "trust" } = Astro.props;
---

<section id={id} class="bg-slate-100 py-8 lg:py-12 border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="section-container text-center">
    <p class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
      Intended Users
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 lg:gap-8 items-center text-base lg:text-lg font-bold text-slate-400 mb-16">
      <span>Investment Committees</span>
      <span class="hidden md:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span>Infrastructure Lenders</span>
      <span class="hidden md:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span>Fund Acquisition Teams</span>
      <span class="hidden md:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span>Independent Engineers</span>
      <span class="hidden md:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span>Technical Advisors</span>
      <span class="hidden md:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span>Risk Underwriters</span>
      <span class="hidden md:inline text-slate-300">•</span>
      <span>Lenders' Counsel</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Methodology Validated -->
    <div class="mb-16">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Methodology tested against documented project outcomes</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 lg:gap-16 text-sm">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-4">
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">18/18</span>
                <span class="text-slate-500 mt-1">California development cohort</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-4">
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">17/17</span>
                <span class="text-slate-500 mt-1">California blind holdout</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-4">
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">7/8</span>
                <span class="text-slate-500 mt-1">International exploratory benchmark</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-4">
                <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">3</span>
                <span class="text-slate-500 mt-1">Outcome classes tested</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Financed · Operational Issues · Failed</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6 leading-relaxed">
          This validation does not imply perfect prediction. It shows that the analytical process produces plausible, auditable, and historically defensible technical gating judgments when applied retrospectively to real projects. Primary validation is concentrated in California utility-scale BESS. International coverage is expanding across Australia and UK.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Note on Testimonials -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Note on Testimonials</p>
        <div class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4 italic">
            <p>We don't publish client testimonials.</p>
            <p>Investment committees don't give public endorsements for services that expose deal-breaking flaws in their pipeline. Our clients value confidentiality over marketing.</p>
            <p>If that's a problem, we're not the right fit.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
